---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../config/siteConfig';
---
<BaseLayout
  title={`Deployment Tiers & Pricing — ${siteConfig.productName}`}
  description="Transparent deployment tiers for Project Aegis: Starter, Growth, and Enterprise. Talk to our engineering team for sizing and production deployment requirements."
  canonicalPath="/pricing"
>
  <div class="py-12 md:py-16 px-4 max-w-5xl mx-auto flex flex-col gap-12">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
      <span class="text-xs font-mono text-accent uppercase tracking-wider">Deployment Tiers</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-text">
        Predictable infrastructure models based on volume.
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-text-muted max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
        Aegis is licensed based on deployment footprint and transaction throughput. We do not charge per-seat fees for operators, analysts, or auditors.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Three Tiers -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <!-- Starter / Shadow Tier -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface flex flex-col justify-between gap-6">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-accent uppercase">Tier 0 / Starter</span>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-text">Developer &amp; Evaluation</h2>
          <p class="text-xs text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
            For local evaluation, staging environments, and shadow-mode transaction validation alongside your existing payment gateway.
          </p>
          <div class="border-t border-border pt-4 mt-2">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-text font-mono">Includes:</span>
            <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1.5 text-xs text-text-muted">
              <li>• Single-node PostgreSQL &amp; Redis</li>
              <li>• In-memory rule evaluation</li>
              <li>• Operator console (all 7 RBAC roles)</li>
              <li>• Historical replay testing</li>
              <li>• Community documentation support</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a
          href="/contact?topic=Pricing"
          class="w-full text-center py-2 px-4 rounded border border-border bg-surface hover:bg-surface-raised text-text text-xs font-semibold transition-colors"
        >
          Talk to us
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Growth Tier -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-lg border border-accent bg-surface relative flex flex-col justify-between gap-6">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-accent uppercase">Tier 1 / Growth</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-accent-solid text-white font-semibold">Recommended</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-text">Production Shadow &amp; Pilot</h2>
          <p class="text-xs text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
            For fintechs and regional payment gateways processing live production volume in dual-run shadow or primary authorization mode.
          </p>
          <div class="border-t border-border pt-4 mt-2">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-text font-mono">Includes:</span>
            <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1.5 text-xs text-text-muted">
              <li>• Clustered Redis velocity engine</li>
              <li>• Partitioned PostgreSQL with RLS</li>
              <li>• Kafka transaction ingest mirror</li>
              <li>• Maker-checker rule workflow</li>
              <li>• Direct Slack &amp; video engineering support</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a
          href="/contact?topic=Pricing"
          class="w-full text-center py-2 px-4 rounded bg-accent-solid hover:bg-accent-hover text-white text-xs font-semibold shadow transition-colors"
        >
          Talk to us
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Enterprise Tier -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface flex flex-col justify-between gap-6">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-accent uppercase">Tier 2 / Enterprise</span>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-text">Institutional Footprint</h2>
          <p class="text-xs text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
            For high-throughput acquiring banks, payment aggregators, and enterprise platforms requiring strict single-tenant or VPC isolation.
          </p>
          <div class="border-t border-border pt-4 mt-2">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-text font-mono">Includes:</span>
            <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1.5 text-xs text-text-muted">
              <li>• Dedicated AWS/GCP single-tenant VPC</li>
              <li>• Multi-AZ active-passive failover</li>
              <li>• Hardware Security Module (HSM) keys</li>
              <li>• Cryptographic Merkle audit ledger</li>
              <li>• Tailored SLA &amp; dedicated solutions engineer</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a
          href="/contact?topic=Pricing"
          class="w-full text-center py-2 px-4 rounded border border-border bg-surface hover:bg-surface-raised text-text text-xs font-semibold transition-colors"
        >
          Talk to us
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Pricing FAQ -->
    <section class="border-t border-border pt-12">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text mb-6">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 text-xs text-text-muted">
        <div class="p-4 rounded border border-border bg-surface">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-text mb-1">Are there per-seat licensing fees?</h3>
          <p class="leading-relaxed">No. We do not charge per user account. You can invite as many risk analysts, risk managers, auditors, and developers as your organization requires.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded border border-border bg-surface">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-text mb-1">How does shadow mode deployment work?</h3>
          <p class="leading-relaxed">In shadow mode, your existing gateway mirrors transaction events asynchronously to Aegis. The engine runs rule evaluations and persists decisions without impacting your primary payment authorization path.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded border border-border bg-surface">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-text mb-1">Can we run Aegis in our own cloud environment?</h3>
          <p class="leading-relaxed">Yes. Aegis provides clean-room Terraform blueprints for deployment within your own AWS or GCP virtual private cloud accounts.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded border border-border bg-surface">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-text mb-1">How are historical backtests billed?</h3>
          <p class="leading-relaxed">Replay evaluations execute against your local or dedicated infrastructure cluster. There are no additional per-backtest surcharges.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

